{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/73d2ed1df6e3ddcd42240cb6ce1c0807.avif?t=1767627171\" width=1200 height=200 /></span><strong>A story-driven game with a vast lore-rich world, filled with interactions~!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game follows Leere, a girl that was sent to an unknown land with vague memories of her old world...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Heroine has no easy way to return and has to struggle to have even a possibility of coming back, but... maybe the world she found herself in isn't such a bad place? Maybe it's worth to explore it further instead of going back? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is ticking and dangers increase with time</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive story/optional dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a colorful world together with the heroine, and learn more about the current world and its mysterious history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/bbcf61ff9ef0c2e7bb5f4cc61c7bc473.poster.avif?t=1767627171\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/bbcf61ff9ef0c2e7bb5f4cc61c7bc473.webm?t=1767627171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/bbcf61ff9ef0c2e7bb5f4cc61c7bc473.mp4?t=1767627171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/7efa3b4947811a5443bd091bb21d70f6.avif?t=1767627171\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Vibrant characters that (may?) share the journey with you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the story-related characters who will definitely want to make themselves known!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/aa890db59385210d31034b4fdab0b162.avif?t=1767627171\" width=1400 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may follow you and provide their unique perspectives and abilities~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/7efa3b4947811a5443bd091bb21d70f6.avif?t=1767627171\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intense bullet hell gameplay with unique abilities and weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/d6c399293e2e11ad55d85e8eae52e68d.poster.avif?t=1767627171\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/d6c399293e2e11ad55d85e8eae52e68d.webm?t=1767627171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/d6c399293e2e11ad55d85e8eae52e68d.mp4?t=1767627171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore each new location, the challenges keep getting tougher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h